      "title_at_amendment": "Instrument markings: general.",
      "text": "For each instrument-- (a) When markings are on the cover glass of the instrument, there must be means to maintain the correct alignment of the glass cover with the face of the dial; and (b) Each arc and line must be wide enough and located to be clearly visible to the pilot.",
